24,"name":"Denis Kozinets","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d5heMF1n64PVi0g907TLvGUCcVZ.jpg"},{"id":2405118,"name":"Anton Pulit","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t7ihLKj5gslQWcGHPdwqoUgLU8J.jpg"},{"id":2146682,"name":"Aleksey Simonov","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nB6H8HN6E75ITL6RuQZMRas93Dt.jpg"},{"id":2469695,"name":"Sergey Trifonov","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rD7Iy6owjKX0jGKgO33jOgendjb.jpg"},{"id":2453166,"name":"Kirill Baloban","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yZDe2ZBKcEZtRj1QOBCmsDOqax1.jpg"},{"id":2968844,"name":"Yakov Petrov","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pICJreFh5SYeceUneRW5kQrwoFD.jpg"},{"id":2299882,"name":"Artyom Leshchik","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3N5zL9wX4pdASXF8hU41do9bjwt.jpg"},{"id":2530967,"name":"Valery Smekalov","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iTojGng5QIzmCgOyU2VLGNM6RgG.jpg"},{"id":1112290,"name":"Tatyana Polonskaya","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4KPuLFlBYa0AMivkyzlxrJ74eSG.jpg"},{"id":2453165,"name":"Egor Bakulin","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5ZV4zvOphqxX4LqeGxLDxa5PmaN.jpg"},{"id":2697350,"name":"Yana Ronin","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kACdDxNkwRhoTldPGuy0MdcqD9f.jpg"},{"id":2419245,"name":"Kirill Yakushenko","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kdmEjNsZmy163FfsEyDtS1Rk2g4.jpg"},{"id":2524263,"name":"Igor Pavlov","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/80vhV2Ok6b6MvxHZperoLy6431l.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Pattini d'argento","overview":"Siamo alle soglie del Novecento. Come ogni inverno, San Pietroburgo si trasforma in un paesaggio da favola, con i suoi fiumi ghiacciati e i canali in festa. Nella città vive il diciottenne Matvey, che lavora come garzone in una nota panetteria. Figlio di un povero lampionaio, ha come unico tesoro un paio di pattini d'argento ereditati dal padre. Altrove, Alisa, la figlia di un alto funzionario, si sente prigioniera nella villa del padre. Le loro due strade sono destinate a incrociarsi con conseguenze imprevedibili."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Silver Skates","overview":"1899, the Christmas-time St.Petersburg. Ice-covered rivers and canals of the capital seethe with festive activities. On the eve of the new century those who should not be destined to meet, come together. They are people from different worlds: Matvey, the son of a lamplighter, whose only treasure is his silver-plated skates; Alice is the daughter of a high-ranking official dreaming of science. Each of them has his own difficult life-story, but having accidentally met they rush forward together in pursuit of their dreams.","tagline":"A Magical Journey Awaits You!"},{"language":"ru-RU","title":"Серебряные коньки","overview":"1899 год, рождественский Петербург. Яркая праздничная жизнь бурлит на скованных льдом реках и каналах столицы. Накануне нового столетия судьба сводит тех, кому, казалось бы, не суждено было встретиться. Люди из совершенно разных миров, Матвей — сын фонарщика, его единственное богатство — доставшиеся по наследству посеребрённые коньки; Алиса — дочь крупного сановника, грезящая о науке. У каждого — своя непростая история, но, однажды столкнувшись, они устремляются к мечте вместе."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/irXWELZfWW8tehfNV82O2UT258r.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n96Mu6w9yGO3MM9yuBrYlVvc6gb.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":576920,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/irXWELZfWW8tehfNV82O2UT258r.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/irXWELZfWW8tehfNV82O2UT258r.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},"candid